@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@token = paste-login-token-here
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@audienceId1 = 1
@audienceId2 = 2
@audienceId3 = 3
@planId = 1
@planVersion = 0
@idempotencyToken = paste-one-time-token-from-idempotency-token-response-here
@requestId = paste-request-id-from-submit-response-here
@orderId = paste-order-id-here

### 1. 创建实名观演人（长期保存，证件号服务端加密）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/audiences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "张三",
  "idType": "ID_CARD",
  "idNo": "110101199001011234"
}

### 2. 开售前从演出详情页创建预约计划，默认观演人用于预填
### 预约只是填单方案，不占库存、不锁定价格，也不保证开售时有票
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "defaultAudienceIds": [{{audienceId1}}, {{audienceId2}}, {{audienceId3}}]
}

### 2.1 查看当前用户预约计划及状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.2 查看单个预约计划（包括当前状态和版本）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 开售前选择或修改场次、票档和购票数量
### 修改任何方案字段都会使已完成版本失效，需重新完成预约
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/spec
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 3,
  "version": {{planVersion}}
}

### 4. 观演人数量必须严格等于购票数量；开售前可修改
### 本例 spec 更新后 version 为 1；若替换观演人，请传最新版本
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/audiences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audienceIds": [{{audienceId1}}, {{audienceId2}}, {{audienceId3}}],
  "version": 1
}

### 5. 开售前明确完成预约：只完成方案并冻结观演人身份快照
### 不创建抢票请求、不预扣或占用库存；本例 audiences 更新后 version 为 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 2
}

### 5.1 开售后提交前获取一次性幂等 token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 开售后手动提交预约抢票
### 仅传服务端方案版本、一次性幂等 token 和可选准入 token；不要传 audienceIds/场次/票档/数量
### 服务端从已完成预约读取场次、票档、数量和冻结观演人快照
### 完成预约不保证库存或价格，提交仍会校验开售窗口、票档和实时库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 3,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}"
}

### 7. 查询异步抢票/创单结果；把 submit 响应中的 requestId 填入 @requestId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7.1 查询预约计划状态；请求绑定或发送结果不确定时可能为 RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED 时不要换 token 重新提交或盲目重试，等待服务端对账收敛后再处理

### 8. 预约提交成功创建正式订单后再创建支付单（金额以正式订单快照为准）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "channel": "MOCK"
}

### 9. 没有开售前完成预约，或预约已过期时，开售后走普通抢票接口
### 普通抢票同样返回 requestId，并经异步下单主链路处理；不享受预约自动填单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "paste-one-time-order-token-here"
}

### 10. 取消尚未创单的可编辑预约计划（按当前版本号）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 3
}
